      "text": "The platform's own GPS trace measures 27.18 km against a booked optimal of 21.0 km — an excess of 6.18 km, or 29.4% of optimal. That excess is real, but it is NOT a MATERIAL deviation: it falls below BOTH of POL-RD-01's materiality thresholds (greater than 50% of optimal_distance_km, and greater than 8.0 km absolute). The consequence is that the POL-RD-06 driver_profile check is not engaged, no driver-conduct referral follows, and no FULL_REFUND uplift of charged_total is available. The remedy is confined to the POL-RD-02 partial refund.",
